---Action represents an issue requiring administrator action for resolution.
---@class gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1Action
---@field issue? string Detailed description of the issue requiring action.
---@field unauthorizedResource? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1ActionUnauthorizedResource Details for issues related to lack of permissions to access data resources.
---@field name? string Output only. The relative resource name of the action, of the form: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/lakes/{lake}/actions/{action} projects/{project}/locations/{location}/lakes/{lake}/zones/{zone}/actions/{action} projects/{project}/locations/{location}/lakes/{lake}/zones/{zone}/assets/{asset}/actions/{action}.
---@field missingResource? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1ActionMissingResource Details for issues related to absence of a managed resource.
---@field missingData? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1ActionMissingData Details for issues related to absence of data within managed resources.
---@field lake? string Output only. The relative resource name of the lake, of the form: projects/{project_number}/locations/{location_id}/lakes/{lake_id}.
---@field category? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1ActionCategoryEnum The category of issue associated with the action.
---@field invalidDataFormat? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1ActionInvalidDataFormat Details for issues related to invalid or unsupported data formats.
---@field zone? string Output only. The relative resource name of the zone, of the form: projects/{project_number}/locations/{location_id}/lakes/{lake_id}/zones/{zone_id}.
---@field asset? string Output only. The relative resource name of the asset, of the form: projects/{project_number}/locations/{location_id}/lakes/{lake_id}/zones/{zone_id}/assets/{asset_id}.
---@field incompatibleDataSchema? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1ActionIncompatibleDataSchema Details for issues related to incompatible schemas detected within data.
