---@field changes? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1BatchChangeMetadataRequestChangeList Required. The list of changes to apply. Only a single change per resource is supported. Maximum number of changes supported is 250.
---@field name? string Required. The resource name of the EntryGroup on which the batch change applies. Format: projects/{project_number_or_id}/locations/{location_id}/entryGroups/{entry_group_id}

