---@field validateOnly? boolean Optional. Validates the request without actually creating the Glossary. Default: false.
---@field parent? string Required. The parent resource where this Glossary will be created. Format: projects/{project_id_or_number}/locations/{location_id} where location_id refers to a Google Cloud region.

