---@field iamRoles? gcp.dataplex_v1.StringList Optional. IAM roles granted on the resource to this access group. Role name follows https://cloud.google.com/iam/docs/reference/rest/v1/roles.Example: [ "roles/bigquery.dataViewer" ]

