---Represents a user-visible job which provides the insights for the related data source.For example: Data quality: generates queries based on the rules and runs against the data to get data quality check results. For more information, see Auto data quality overview (https://cloud.google.com/dataplex/docs/auto-data-quality-overview). Data profile: analyzes the data in tables and generates insights about the structure, content and relationships (such as null percent, cardinality, min/max/mean, etc). For more information, see About data profiling (https://cloud.google.com/dataplex/docs/data-profiling-overview). Data discovery: scans data in Cloud Storage buckets to extract and then catalog metadata. For more information, see Discover and catalog Cloud Storage data (https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/automatic-discovery). Data documentation: analyzes the table or dataset metadata and generates insights. For tables, insights include descriptions and sample SQL queries. For datasets, insights include descriptions, schema relationships and sample SQL queries. For more information, see Generate data insights in BigQuery (https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/data-insights).
---@class gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataScan
---@field data? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataSource Required. The data source for DataScan.
---@field dataProfileSpec? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataProfileSpec Settings for a data profile scan.
---@field executionIdentity? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1ExecutionIdentity Optional. Immutable. The identity to run the datascan. If not specified, defaults to the Dataplex Service Agent.
---@field state? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataScanStateEnum Output only. Current state of the DataScan.
---@field executionSpec? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataScanExecutionSpec Optional. DataScan execution settings.If not specified, the fields in it will use their default values.
---@field dataProfileResult? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataProfileResult Output only. The result of a data profile scan.
---@field executionStatus? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataScanExecutionStatus Output only. Status of the data scan execution.
---@field name? string Output only. Identifier. The relative resource name of the scan, of the form: projects/{project}/locations/{location_id}/dataScans/{datascan_id}, where project refers to a project_id or project_number and location_id refers to a Google Cloud region.
---@field description? string Optional. Description of the scan. Must be between 1-1024 characters.
---@field displayName? string Optional. User friendly display name. Must be between 1-256 characters.
---@field dataDocumentationSpec? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataDocumentationSpec Settings for a data documentation scan.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The time when the scan was last updated.
---@field dataDiscoverySpec? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataDiscoverySpec Settings for a data discovery scan.
---@field dataDiscoveryResult? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataDiscoveryResult Output only. The result of a data discovery scan.
---@field dataDocumentationResult? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataDocumentationResult Output only. The result of a data documentation scan.
---@field labels? gcp.dataplex_v1.StringMap Optional. User-defined labels for the scan.
---@field dataQualityResult? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataQualityResult Output only. The result of a data quality scan.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time when the scan was created.
---@field uid? string Output only. System generated globally unique ID for the scan. This ID will be different if the scan is deleted and re-created with the same name.
---@field dataQualitySpec? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataQualitySpec Settings for a data quality scan.
---@field type? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1DataScanTypeEnum Output only. The type of DataScan.
---@field unstructuredDataProfileSpec? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1UnstructuredDataProfileSpec Optional. Settings for an unstructured data profile scan.
---@field unstructuredDataProfileResult? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1UnstructuredDataProfileResult Output only. The result of an unstructured data profile scan.

