---Represents tables and fileset metadata contained within a zone.
---@class gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1Entity
---@field system? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntitySystemEnum Required. Immutable. Identifies the storage system of the entity data.
---@field etag? string Optional. The etag associated with the entity, which can be retrieved with a GetEntity request. Required for update and delete requests.
---@field schema? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1Schema Required. The description of the data structure and layout. The schema is not included in list responses. It is only included in SCHEMA and FULL entity views of a GetEntity response.
---@field format? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1StorageFormat Required. Identifies the storage format of the entity data. It does not apply to entities with data stored in BigQuery.
---@field catalogEntry? string Output only. The name of the associated Data Catalog entry.
---@field dataPath? string Required. Immutable. The storage path of the entity data. For Cloud Storage data, this is the fully-qualified path to the entity, such as gs://bucket/path/to/data. For BigQuery data, this is the name of the table resource, such as projects/project_id/datasets/dataset_id/tables/table_id.
---@field type? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntityTypeEnum Required. Immutable. The type of entity.
---@field asset? string Required. Immutable. The ID of the asset associated with the storage location containing the entity data. The entity must be with in the same zone with the asset.
---@field id? string Required. A user-provided entity ID. It is mutable, and will be used as the published table name. Specifying a new ID in an update entity request will override the existing value. The ID must contain only letters (a-z, A-Z), numbers (0-9), and underscores, and consist of 256 or fewer characters.
---@field compatibility? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntityCompatibilityStatus Output only. Metadata stores that the entity is compatible with.
---@field displayName? string Optional. Display name must be shorter than or equal to 256 characters.
---@field name? string Output only. The resource name of the entity, of the form: projects/{project_number}/locations/{location_id}/lakes/{lake_id}/zones/{zone_id}/entities/{id}.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The time when the entity was last updated.
---@field uid? string Output only. System generated unique ID for the Entity. This ID will be different if the Entity is deleted and re-created with the same name.
---@field description? string Optional. User friendly longer description text. Must be shorter than or equal to 1024 characters.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time when the entity was created.
---@field access? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1StorageAccess Output only. Identifies the access mechanism to the entity. Not user settable.
---@field dataPathPattern? string Optional. The set of items within the data path constituting the data in the entity, represented as a glob path. Example: gs://bucket/path/to/data/**/*.csv.

---Provides compatibility information for various metadata stores.
---@class gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntityCompatibilityStatus
---@field hiveMetastore? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntityCompatibilityStatusCompatibility Output only. Whether this entity is compatible with Hive Metastore.
---@field bigquery? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntityCompatibilityStatusCompatibility Output only. Whether this entity is compatible with BigQuery.

---Provides compatibility information for a specific metadata store.
---@class gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntityCompatibilityStatusCompatibility
---@field reason? string Output only. Provides additional detail if the entity is incompatible with the metadata store.
---@field compatible? boolean Output only. Whether the entity is compatible and can be represented in the metadata store.

---@alias gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntityList gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1Entity[]

---@alias gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntitySystemEnum "STORAGE_SYSTEM_UNSPECIFIED"|"CLOUD_STORAGE"|"BIGQUERY"

---@alias gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntityTypeEnum "TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"TABLE"|"FILESET"

---An entry is a representation of a data resource that can be described by various metadata.
---@class gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1Entry
---@field entryType? string Required. Immutable. The relative resource name of the entry type that was used to create this entry, in the format projects/{project_id_or_number}/locations/{location_id}/entryTypes/{entry_type_id}.
---@field parentEntry? string Optional. Immutable. The resource name of the parent entry, in the format projects/{project_id_or_number}/locations/{location_id}/entryGroups/{entry_group_id}/entries/{entry_id}.
---@field entrySource? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntrySource Optional. Information related to the source system of the data resource that is represented by the entry.
---@field aspects? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1AspectMap Optional. The aspects that are attached to the entry. Depending on how the aspect is attached to the entry, the format of the aspect key can be one of the following: If the aspect is attached directly to the entry: {project_id_or_number}.{location_id}.{aspect_type_id} If the aspect is attached to an entry's path: {project_id_or_number}.{location_id}.{aspect_type_id}@{path}
---@field name? string Identifier. The relative resource name of the entry, in the format projects/{project_id_or_number}/locations/{location_id}/entryGroups/{entry_group_id}/entries/{entry_id}.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time when the entry was created in Dataplex Universal Catalog.
---@field fullyQualifiedName? string Optional. A name for the entry that can be referenced by an external system. For more information, see Fully qualified names (https://cloud.google.com/data-catalog/docs/fully-qualified-names). The maximum size of the field is 4000 characters.
---@field entryGroupType? string Output only. The type of the EntryGroup that this entry belongs to. The default value is an empty string. Recognised values include: * context-set: EntryGroup containing context set data assets.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The time when the entry was last updated in Dataplex Universal Catalog.

---An Entry Group represents a logical grouping of one or more Entries.
