---@field labels? gcp.dataplex_v1.StringMap Optional. User-defined labels for the EntryGroup.
---@field transferStatus? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntryGroupTransferStatusEnum Output only. Denotes the transfer status of the Entry Group. It is unspecified for Entry Group created from Dataplex API.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time when the EntryGroup was created.
---@field uid? string Output only. System generated globally unique ID for the EntryGroup. If you delete and recreate the EntryGroup with the same name, this ID will be different.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The time when the EntryGroup was last updated.
---@field description? string Optional. Description of the EntryGroup.
---@field name? string Output only. The relative resource name of the EntryGroup, in the format projects/{project_id_or_number}/locations/{location_id}/entryGroups/{entry_group_id}.
---@field changeRequestConfig? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntryGroupChangeRequestConfig Optional. Specifies the configuration for requesting changes in the metadata belonging to the Entry Group.
---@field displayName? string Optional. User friendly display name.
---@field type? string Optional. Immutable. The type of this EntryGroup. The default value is an empty string. Recognised values include: * context-set: EntryGroup containing context set data assets.

---Specifies the configuration for requesting changes in the metadata belonging to the Entry Group.
---@class gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntryGroupChangeRequestConfig
---@field approverEmails? gcp.dataplex_v1.StringList Optional. Specifies the email addresses of users who are potential approvers and are notified when a change request is created for the metadata belonging to the Entry Group. The maximum number of emails allowed is 10.

---@alias gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntryGroupList gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntryGroup[]

---@alias gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntryGroupTransferStatusEnum "TRANSFER_STATUS_UNSPECIFIED"|"TRANSFER_STATUS_MIGRATED"|"TRANSFER_STATUS_TRANSFERRED"

---EntryLink represents a link between two Entries.
---@class gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntryLink
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The time when the Entry Link was last updated.
