---Information related to the source system of the data resource that is represented by the entry.
---@class gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntrySource
---@field ancestors? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1EntrySourceAncestorList Immutable. The entries representing the ancestors of the data resource in the source system.
