---@field type? gcp.dataplex_v1.GoogleCloudDataplexV1MetadataJobTypeEnum Required. Metadata job type.
---@field name? string Output only. Identifier. The name of the resource that the configuration is applied to, in the format projects/{project_number}/locations/{location_id}/metadataJobs/{metadata_job_id}.
