---@field properties? gcp.dataplex_v1.StringMap Optional. Override to common configuration of open source components installed on the Dataproc cluster. The properties to set on daemon config files. Property keys are specified in prefix:property format, for example core:hadoop.tmp.dir. For more information, see Cluster properties (https://cloud.google.com/dataproc/docs/concepts/cluster-properties).
---@field pythonPackages? gcp.dataplex_v1.StringList Optional. A list of python packages to be installed. Valid formats include Cloud Storage URI to a PIP installable library. For example, gs://bucket-name/my/path/to/lib.tar.gz
---@field javaJars? gcp.dataplex_v1.StringList Optional. A list of Java JARS to add to the classpath. Valid input includes Cloud Storage URIs to Jar binaries. For example, gs://bucket-name/my/path/to/file.jar
---@field image? string Optional. Container image to use.

